Dr. Khalifa: Well, our teacher next week will be Gatut, IN SHAA ALLAH, Suras 75 and 76, page 76.

01:20:17.000 --> 01:20:22.000
And we turn to God for this time and ask Him to give Robert a great year coming up,

01:20:22.000 --> 01:20:26.000
best year of his life so far, and every year after that to be even greater.

01:20:26.000 --> 01:20:30.000
May God bless him, and continue to give us guidance and wisdom. Al-Fãtehah.

